;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw August to September at 32% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 38% of normal and March to April at 158%. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 24784 at 62%.</p>"}
